F calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Lac qui Parle County came in under 90% of normal in January to February in 39 of the 75 years since 1951. In 2025 the middle ran 174% of normal in June to July, the wettest pair, and 33% in January to February. So far in 2026 the middle ran 50% in February to March and 53% in April to May. Grid 30135 had its driest year in 1976 at 36% of normal.</p>"}
